    "excerpt": "Dry, flaky lips can turn even your favourite lipstick into a patchy, uncomfortable mess. The good news is that the best lip care tips are simple: keep lips moisturised, protect them from the sun, and prepare them properly before colour. Healthy lip skin is thin and delicate, so it needs gentle, regular care. In this guide, you will learn a daily lip care routine, how to exfoliate safely, how to prepare lips for lipstick, and makeup techniques that make lips look fuller. Explore lip care products at Joyory as you go.",
