        "question": "How Can I Make Thin Lips Look Fuller?",
        "answer": "Use a liner slightly beyond your natural lip line, try lighter shades or reflective finishes, and add gloss to the centre of your lower lip. Keep the effect subtle for the most natural result. Gentle care is the foundation of soft-looking lips: moisturise often, protect them with SPF, and exfoliate only when needed. Good preparation then helps lipstick apply more evenly, and simple techniques such as liner, thin layers and a touch of gloss can create the look of fuller lips. Start with one or two changes and stay consistent. To find your next favourite balm or shade, explore the lip care and makeup range at Joyory Beauty."
